 "statement": "The constructed factorization $\\mathsf C_{12}(U/S)$ is a compactification\nof $U\\to S$. Consequently $U\\to S$ is compactifiable.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-thm-nagata-sketch-two-open/thm-nagata-two-open.md",
